    "body": "The completed charges are established by two paid pharmacy claims for metformin 500 mg tablets, 60 tablets for a 30-day supply. On August 18, 2026, the claim at Oak Street Pharmacy applied the preferred retail cost-share category and the member paid $8.00. On September 16, 2026, the claim at Lakeview Pharmacy applied the standard retail cost-share category and the member paid $27.00.\n\nThe pharmacy classifications for those dates identify Oak Street Pharmacy as preferred retail and Lakeview Pharmacy as standard retail. Under the selected policy for this plan and period, the matched 30-day metformin 500 mg supply is $8 at preferred retail and $27 at standard retail under the recorded conditions.",
